    "Straight into the app. Nothing to fill in, nothing to connect." to "Direkt in die App. Nichts ausfüllen, nichts verbinden.",
    "Strain" to "Belastung",
    "Strawberries or citrus" to "Erdbeeren oder Zitrus",
