    "Try the voice input on a real day. The AI is forgiving, you can ramble through \"tired, had wine and pasta, took ibuprofen at 4, felt better by 8\" and it'll log all four." to "Probier die Spracheingabe an einem echten Tag. Die KI ist nachsichtig, du kannst drauflosreden: \"müde, Wein und Pasta, um 4 Ibuprofen, um 8 besser\" — sie erfasst alle vier.",
